        {
          "text": "Na we atakambira Uhoraho: Uhoraho amwereka igiti, agiterera mur’ ayo mazi, aca ahinduka meza. Aho ni ho Uhoraho yabashingiye icagezwe n’ibgirizwa, kand’ aho ni ho yabageragereje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
